Package: loft-node
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: loft
Depends: adduser, openssl, ca-certificates, systemd
Recommends: curl, iproute2
Description: loft overlay node (controller or relay)
 loft occupies the same place as ordinary HTTPS: TLS 1.3 on port 443.
 This package is the node binary, a systemd unit, and Debian layout
 under /etc/loft and /var/lib/loft.
